{
  "$note": "Battle + after-battle, 720x1280. Battle = pause button visible. Battle counts as over only after the pause button is gone in 3 checks ~1s apart; if it comes back, drags resume. After battle: tap Next/OK until the map is back. Continue/give-up/lost text stops the task. UseMove: taps a Yo-kai whose 'Move Ready!' bubble is shown (soultimate), checked between every batch of drags. TalkNext: advances Yo-kai dialogue (befriending etc.) by tapping the yellow down-arrow in the speech box. Lost battle: 'Spend Y-Money to Continue?' -> ContinuePrompt -> TapNo (never Yes). Other lost/retry screens with nothing to tap still stop the task.",
